   "description": "Drives two DC motors (up to 1.2 A each) from VM (4.5-13.5 V), controlled by a board: AIN1 / AIN2 set the way motor A turns (HIGH/LOW forward, LOW/HIGH back, both HIGH brake, both LOW coast), PWMA its speed (analogWrite), the same for B. STBY must be HIGH or nothing moves. VCC is the logic supply (2.7-5.5 V).",
